{"4179070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dakini", "steam_appid": 4179070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179070/extras/14f3ca4648c2a53c0990021e3bdfd5db.poster.avif?t=1768844919\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179070/extras/14f3ca4648c2a53c0990021e3bdfd5db.webm?t=1768844919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179070/extras/14f3ca4648c2a53c0990021e3bdfd5db.mp4?t=1768844919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drowned beneath relentless rain, a forgotten village hides a curse that refuses to die. Searching for someone dear to him, one man steps into the storm and finds something far more terrifying waiting in the dark. The deeper he goes, the more the village awakens. Whispers call his name, the possessed wander the flooded streets, and unseen eyes watch from every shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, he must uncover the truth behind the witch Dakini, a name the villagers still fear to speak. But in a place where every secret festers, some truths are better left buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creeping through the overgrown swamps, even the insects seem to sense something lurking nearby.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179070/extras/8a252d893cfefa70ff50f2f595ca19a5.poster.avif?t=1768844919\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4179070/